9
00:00:04,220 --> 00:00:06,320
It's a bit late to ask now, but how are you feeling?

10
00:00:10,850 --> 00:00:12,280
I'm fine.

11
00:00:12,810 --> 00:00:15,670
Honestly, it's almost more than I can handle.

12
00:00:15,670 --> 00:00:19,290
With this I feel like I could pull off ten, or even twenty projections at once.

13
00:00:20,410 --> 00:00:22,920
I'm just glad it worked.

14
00:00:25,460 --> 00:00:27,940
Okay, now's our chance.

15
00:00:27,940 --> 00:00:28,940
Let's go.

16
00:00:32,480 --> 00:00:36,570
Shirou and I will sneak into Ryuudou Temple from the rear,

17
00:00:36,570 --> 00:00:38,640
and then we'll give you the signal, Saber.

18
00:00:38,640 --> 00:00:42,460
When you see it, storm the temple through the front entrance

19
00:00:42,460 --> 00:00:44,650
and draw his attention to you.

20
00:00:44,650 --> 00:00:45,620
While you're doing that,

21
00:00:45,620 --> 00:00:49,290
we'll find Shinji and the Holy Grail and shut it down.

22
00:00:49,290 --> 00:00:53,020
Once that's done, all that'll be left is for you to destroy the Grail.

23
00:00:53,910 --> 00:00:56,040
Look, about that...

24
00:00:56,040 --> 00:00:57,120
Shirou.

25
00:00:57,580 --> 00:00:59,960
There is something I must tell you first.

26
00:00:59,960 --> 00:01:00,870
Saber?

27
00:01:02,320 --> 00:01:06,460
I will only be able to use my holy sword once.

28
00:01:07,550 --> 00:01:09,310
She has too little mana.

29
00:01:09,310 --> 00:01:13,690
The instant she uses her sword, she'll vanish from this world.

30
00:01:13,690 --> 00:01:15,860
What? Why?

31
00:01:15,860 --> 00:01:17,150
Isn't it obvious?

32
00:01:17,150 --> 00:01:19,600
I'm supplying mana to two people.

33
00:01:21,350 --> 00:01:26,230
Hang on... You expect Saber to keep him busy without using her strongest attack?

34
00:01:26,230 --> 00:01:27,230
Shirou...

35
00:01:27,870 --> 00:01:29,820
This is my decision.

36
00:01:30,680 --> 00:01:32,450
There's no other choice.

37
00:01:32,450 --> 00:01:34,700
This is the only way to be sure.

38
00:01:35,600 --> 00:01:37,880
Saber is my Servant.

39
00:01:39,300 --> 00:01:41,470
Do you think I'd let her die for no reason?

