6692
00:03:52,150 --> 00:03:54,040
Burst the vessel?

6693
00:03:54,040 --> 00:03:56,410
In other words, Shinji.

6694
00:03:56,410 --> 00:04:00,130
He ought to be somewhere in there, linked to it as its core.

6695
00:04:02,940 --> 00:04:04,670
Could that be him up there?

6696
00:04:04,670 --> 00:04:07,010
I see something that looks like a person at the top.

6697
00:04:07,700 --> 00:04:11,770
This time, it seems the Holy Grail is using a human body to power itself.

6698
00:04:12,570 --> 00:04:16,860
But if this continues, the vessel's incompatibility will cause it to break apart completely.

6699
00:04:18,170 --> 00:04:20,700
If that happens, there won't be a Holy Grail anymore.

6700
00:04:20,700 --> 00:04:25,450
There'll just be that dangerous muck 
oozing out of the hole opened by the Grail.

6701
00:04:27,120 --> 00:04:30,780
Then we have to pull Shinji out of there fast!

6702
00:04:30,780 --> 00:04:31,330
Wait!

6703
00:04:31,330 --> 00:04:33,170
You're just walking up to it unprepared?

6704
00:04:33,170 --> 00:04:36,320
That muck is pure curses given physical form!

6705
00:04:36,320 --> 00:04:38,040
We can't know if we don't try!

6706
00:04:38,460 --> 00:04:40,010
There's no time to lose!

6707
00:04:40,010 --> 00:04:43,030
Given who Saber's up against,

6708
00:04:43,030 --> 00:04:45,010
we don't have time for indecision.

6709
00:04:45,010 --> 00:04:46,930
What a surprise this is.

6710
00:04:47,440 --> 00:04:51,350
To think your misshapen faces would sully my vision a third time,

6711
00:04:52,030 --> 00:04:53,230
mongrels.

6712
00:04:54,060 --> 00:04:55,310
Gilgamesh!

6713
00:04:55,690 --> 00:04:58,330
No way! If you're here, then who is Saber fighting?!

6714
00:05:08,050 --> 00:05:09,860
I have been waiting.

6715
00:05:09,860 --> 00:05:12,620
I am glad that you arrived in time, Saber.

6716
00:05:13,040 --> 00:05:14,290
Assassin?

6717
00:05:14,290 --> 00:05:15,440
Impossible.

6718
00:05:15,440 --> 00:05:16,910
With Caster gone,

6719
00:05:16,910 --> 00:05:18,880
you should not have remained in this world!

6720
00:05:20,090 --> 00:05:22,580
True, but I am a unique case, you see.

6721
00:05:22,580 --> 00:05:27,300
I am a false Servant, summoned with this location as my anchor.

6722
00:05:28,080 --> 00:05:33,450
Thus I am a gatekeeper that may only appear at this main gate.

6723
00:05:33,450 --> 00:05:34,640
Of course,

6724
00:05:35,200 --> 00:05:37,230
with that vixen gone,

6725
00:05:37,910 --> 00:05:40,130
I shan't survive the night.

6726
00:05:40,130 --> 00:05:43,740
That I have managed to last this long is simply good fortune.

6727
00:05:48,000 --> 00:05:49,620
It appears that both you and Saber

6728
00:05:50,030 --> 00:05:52,790
have been forsaken by fate.

6729
00:05:52,790 --> 00:05:59,000
Were you unaware that a Servant who yet 
lingers in this world is still at the main gate?

6730
00:05:59,000 --> 00:06:00,260
Assassin...

6731
00:06:00,260 --> 00:06:03,000
No way... He's still here?

6732
00:06:03,580 --> 00:06:08,030
Now, then. Simply killing you would be dull.

6733
00:06:08,030 --> 00:06:11,260
So I shall grant you a brief reprieve.

6734
00:06:11,630 --> 00:06:13,410
A reprieve?

6735
00:06:14,170 --> 00:06:18,870
I would feel sorry for Shinji if none but I were there at the conclusion.

6736
00:06:18,870 --> 00:06:23,900
Bearing witness to how this ends will give even your lives meaning.

6737
00:06:23,900 --> 00:06:29,030
Are you seriously planning to commit genocide against the human race?

6738
00:06:32,680 --> 00:06:37,470
Do you think merely putting your life on the line 
entitles you to question me?

6739
00:06:38,320 --> 00:06:42,170
This world has become far too kind to humans.

6740
00:06:42,870 --> 00:06:46,000
And therein lies your answer, little girl.

6741
00:06:46,000 --> 00:06:49,790
This era, in which the rabble have bred to excess,

6742
00:06:49,790 --> 00:06:51,890
has grown far too unsightly.

6743
00:06:53,020 --> 00:06:54,220
What?

6744
00:06:54,680 --> 00:06:59,590
In the past—in my world—none were extraneous.

6745
00:06:59,590 --> 00:07:02,480
Even if one were a slave, one had purpose.

6746
00:07:02,480 --> 00:07:05,700
No matter who one was, one's life had significance.

6747
00:07:05,700 --> 00:07:08,140
But what of this era?

6748
00:07:08,140 --> 00:07:10,880
There exists more people than there is purpose and significance.

6749
00:07:11,770 --> 00:07:20,500
Surely you yourselves also believe that you have allowed your numbers to grow too great.

6750
00:07:23,180 --> 00:07:28,300
So I propose to personally cull the herd of mongrels.

6751
00:07:29,080 --> 00:07:32,960
The attempt ten years ago took fewer than five hundred.

6752
00:07:32,960 --> 00:07:36,560
But this time, disaster will rain down upon the entire world.

6753
00:07:37,230 --> 00:07:39,670
Once the extraneous rabble have been weeded out,

6754
00:07:40,880 --> 00:07:43,560
we shall find out how many people of value remain.

6755
00:07:44,290 --> 00:07:46,190
Does the thought not excite you?

6756
00:07:46,190 --> 00:07:50,110
Only a sicko like you would find that exciting!

6757
00:07:50,830 --> 00:07:53,280
I was a fool to expect a straight answer.

6758
00:07:53,940 --> 00:07:56,530
I'll put an end to your Holy Grail right now!

6759
00:07:57,290 --> 00:07:58,870
Tohsaka?

6760
00:07:58,870 --> 00:08:01,030
I'll pull Shinji out.

6761
00:08:01,900 --> 00:08:04,670
Whatever else he is, he's still Sakura's brother.

6762
00:08:05,480 --> 00:08:06,630
Besides,

6763
00:08:07,190 --> 00:08:10,830
isn't it your rule to save anyone as long as it's possible?

6764
00:08:14,270 --> 00:08:16,770
You mean to simply walk through those curses?

6765
00:08:16,770 --> 00:08:20,140
Do you think a lowly human could wade through that morass?

6766
00:08:21,230 --> 00:08:22,480
Don't underestimate me.

6767
00:08:22,960 --> 00:08:26,190
I can handle curses like these as if they were nothing.

6768
00:08:27,040 --> 00:08:30,690
Do or die, eh? How very charming.

6769
00:08:31,330 --> 00:08:32,570
However,

6770
00:08:33,120 --> 00:08:36,870
who gave you permission to leave my presence?

6771
00:08:39,530 --> 00:08:41,660
Tohsaka! See to Shinji!

6772
00:08:42,050 --> 00:08:43,030
On it!

6773
00:08:46,630 --> 00:08:48,820
Keep your hands off Tohsaka!

6774
00:08:48,820 --> 00:08:50,550
I'll take you on!

6775
00:08:51,410 --> 00:08:55,010
This was to be a bit of sport before I greeted Saber,

6776
00:08:55,010 --> 00:08:57,550
but it's proven most tedious.

6777
00:08:58,130 --> 00:09:00,610
You filthy sham.

6778
00:09:00,610 --> 00:09:05,100
Learn firsthand the difference between counterfeits and the real thing!

6779
00:09:10,750 --> 00:09:12,710
Stand aside, Assassin.

6780
00:09:12,710 --> 00:09:15,110
Surely you have no further reason to guard this gate.

6781
00:09:16,710 --> 00:09:17,870
Reason, you say?

6782
00:09:18,590 --> 00:09:21,880
In fairness, I have never had a reason to fight.

6783
00:09:21,880 --> 00:09:27,000
For I have neither the pride of a Heroic Spirit 
nor any wish to be granted.

6784
00:09:27,490 --> 00:09:31,670
After all, I am not even Sasaki Kojirou.

6785
00:09:33,410 --> 00:09:35,890
You need not be so astonished.

6786
00:09:35,890 --> 00:09:39,100
At some point, a man named Sasaki Kojirou likely existed.

6787
00:09:39,630 --> 00:09:44,690
There was likely also a warrior who wielded a longsword named Monohoshizao.

6788
00:09:44,690 --> 00:09:47,970
However, those two are not the same individual.

6789
00:09:48,770 --> 00:09:54,670
The Sasaki Kojirou celebrated as the foil to a renowned swordsman

6790
00:09:54,670 --> 00:09:57,990
is but a fictional entity who never existed.

6791
00:09:57,990 --> 00:09:59,990
A fictional Heroic Spirit...

6792
00:09:59,990 --> 00:10:03,760
Indeed. "Sasaki Kojirou" is a mantle.

6793
00:10:03,760 --> 00:10:09,040
I was merely the swordsman deemed most suitable to wear it.

6794
00:10:09,550 --> 00:10:11,320
I have no name.

6795
00:10:12,510 --> 00:10:13,950
I am but a ghost,

6796
00:10:13,950 --> 00:10:21,350
summoned solely for my ability to perform the techniques that Sasaki Kojirou is said to have mastered.

6797
00:10:23,010 --> 00:10:26,610
Thus there was never any meaning to be found.

6798
00:10:26,610 --> 00:10:31,020
I am empty, so all things are meaningless for me.

6799
00:10:31,510 --> 00:10:32,370
However...

6800
00:10:33,960 --> 00:10:38,130
If there was anything even I could find meaningful,

6801
00:10:40,190 --> 00:10:42,210
it would be this moment.

6802
00:10:42,210 --> 00:10:44,950
That is, if a man who went to his death in obscurity

6803
00:10:45,470 --> 00:10:48,440
could have such a thing as a wish.

6804
00:10:49,720 --> 00:10:50,700
Assassin...

6805
00:11:02,680 --> 00:11:03,720
Come on...

6806
00:11:03,720 --> 00:11:07,630
This is just too gross!

6807
00:11:16,770 --> 00:11:18,150
Shit...

6808
00:11:18,520 --> 00:11:21,120
Learn your place, mongrel.

6809
00:11:21,120 --> 00:11:23,950
You will spoil the festivities.

6810
00:11:26,030 --> 00:11:28,330
Oh, I see it is finally time.

6811
00:11:55,530 --> 00:11:56,810
Boy.

6812
00:11:56,810 --> 00:11:58,690
Do you know what that is?

6813
00:11:59,230 --> 00:12:02,030
Those are wishes being drawn up by the Holy Grail.

6814
00:12:02,030 --> 00:12:04,450
The true nature of you mongrels.

6815
00:12:04,450 --> 00:12:07,490
The malevolence of humanity.

6816
00:12:16,380 --> 00:12:18,850
To be able to grant any and all wishes

6817
00:12:19,920 --> 00:12:23,450
means to effect material change upon the world

6818
00:12:23,450 --> 00:12:26,550
beyond the limits of what can be achieved by any living thing.

6819
00:12:28,460 --> 00:12:34,930
Humanity cannot grant its own wishes, for you are inherently limited beings.

6820
00:12:34,930 --> 00:12:38,450
Whether they are for equality, peace, or happiness,

6821
00:12:38,450 --> 00:12:43,890
those wishes will never be fulfilled by you, prisoners of your flesh.

6822
00:12:45,030 --> 00:12:49,540
That is why you humans constructed that Holy Grail—

6823
00:12:49,540 --> 00:12:52,730
not to be set free from all suffering

6824
00:12:52,730 --> 00:12:56,130
but rather to overcome it.

6825
00:13:05,680 --> 00:13:08,400
However, the end result of that ideal is as you see.

6826
00:13:08,400 --> 00:13:14,450
Nothing holds more power to change the world than the malevolent desires of humanity.

6827
00:13:14,450 --> 00:13:19,270
And so, fueled by malevolence, your cup of salvation can only bring about self-annihilation.

6828
00:13:20,400 --> 00:13:23,030
Behold your true nature.

6829
00:13:23,030 --> 00:13:26,450
Witness the shape an omnipotent wish-granter takes in this age.

6830
00:13:26,870 --> 00:13:29,740
It will be far larger in scope than ten years ago.

6831
00:13:30,450 --> 00:13:34,030
The curses will stream forth without end.

6832
00:13:34,030 --> 00:13:35,040
Now...

6833
00:13:35,700 --> 00:13:37,040
What will you do, boy?

6834
00:13:42,190 --> 00:13:43,540
Good.

6835
00:13:43,540 --> 00:13:46,590
This will provide me some sport.

6836
00:14:01,740 --> 00:14:02,800
Shinji...

6837
00:14:07,660 --> 00:14:10,680
Come on, time to get out of this awful place.

6838
00:14:15,280 --> 00:14:19,380
He may be a useless core, but you don't want to let him go?

6839
00:14:30,520 --> 00:14:33,810
Well, I guess anyone would be upset at having their heart yanked out.

6840
00:14:34,640 --> 00:14:36,730
Down we go, Shinji.

6841
00:14:44,860 --> 00:14:47,830
To be king is so constrictive.

6842
00:14:47,830 --> 00:14:51,990
The instant I take a mongrel like you seriously, 
that is defeat in my eyes.

6843
00:14:51,990 --> 00:14:55,020
Hence, you may rejoice.

6844
00:14:55,020 --> 00:14:57,080
I shall not go all-out against you.

6845
00:14:57,390 --> 00:14:58,500
Trace...

6846
00:14:59,420 --> 00:15:00,290
on!

6847
00:15:07,220 --> 00:15:08,550
Trace on!

6848
00:15:09,000 --> 00:15:10,110
What's the matter?

6849
00:15:10,110 --> 00:15:11,930
Your quality seems to be slipping.

6850
00:15:12,640 --> 00:15:16,210
Is your tongue the only thing of substance about you, faker?

6851
00:15:17,990 --> 00:15:19,170
It's up to you...

6852
00:15:19,770 --> 00:15:21,480
to defeat him.

6853
00:15:21,480 --> 00:15:23,000
Damn it, Archer...

6854
00:15:23,000 --> 00:15:25,400
How am I supposed to do that?

6855
00:15:25,960 --> 00:15:30,380
I'm not good enough to fend off his Noble Phantasms.

6856
00:15:30,380 --> 00:15:33,410
There's only one thing I can do.

6857
00:15:33,840 --> 00:15:39,160
My only hope is to neutralize the Noble Phantasms he fires by firing back the exact same items.

6858
00:15:39,680 --> 00:15:40,570
So...

6859
00:15:42,450 --> 00:15:43,540
Trace...

6860
00:15:49,590 --> 00:15:51,150
I'll copy them all.

6861
00:15:52,380 --> 00:15:53,620
Every last one!

6862
00:15:54,240 --> 00:15:54,930
...on!

6863
00:16:04,060 --> 00:16:06,700
Possession experience, assimilation complete!

6864
00:16:06,700 --> 00:16:09,610
Production complete! All projections, stand by!

6865
00:16:09,950 --> 00:16:13,110
Oh, you're producing several this time.

6866
00:16:13,110 --> 00:16:18,240
I see. You have duplicated all of my 
Noble Phantasms in your field of view.

6867
00:16:18,820 --> 00:16:20,450
Then let us score your efforts.

6868
00:16:21,200 --> 00:16:23,650
Of course, no matter how faithful the reproductions,

6869
00:16:23,650 --> 00:16:26,750
I shan't allow a single one to remain.

6870
00:16:26,750 --> 00:16:28,590
Release freeze...

6871
00:16:28,590 --> 00:16:31,510
All projections, successive fire!

6872
00:16:39,600 --> 00:16:42,590
Quite durable, for glasswork.

6873
00:16:42,590 --> 00:16:46,900
But if you don't copy faster, you'll be cut to pieces.

6874
00:16:46,900 --> 00:16:49,060
Trace on!

6875
00:16:52,190 --> 00:16:54,910
What an utterly foolish notion.

6876
00:16:55,690 --> 00:17:00,810
You were right to target the Holy Grail 
under the assumption that you cannot beat me.

6877
00:17:01,680 --> 00:17:06,800
But if that is your thinking, simply killing that man would be better.

6878
00:17:06,800 --> 00:17:09,030
If you wish to stop the Holy Grail,

6879
00:17:09,030 --> 00:17:12,170
the most effective way is to eliminate Shinji.

6880
00:17:12,700 --> 00:17:16,430
To try to save him nonetheless is hypocrisy.

6881
00:17:16,940 --> 00:17:19,760
An act which sums up you mongrels perfectly.

6882
00:17:25,170 --> 00:17:26,020
What?

6883
00:17:42,920 --> 00:17:46,400
It's lost its core and now desires me as its replacement?

6884
00:17:52,800 --> 00:17:53,910
Tohsaka...

6885
00:18:05,940 --> 00:18:07,600
What the hell is that?

6886
00:18:08,120 --> 00:18:09,730
I can't get a read on it.

6887
00:18:09,730 --> 00:18:14,110
I can't even get a read on its structure!

6888
00:18:22,270 --> 00:18:23,700
Exterminate it,

6889
00:18:24,250 --> 00:18:24,870
Ea.

6890
00:18:41,800 --> 00:18:44,770
I thought I was holding back.

6891
00:18:45,350 --> 00:18:49,850
But at this rate, sparing Archer would have afforded me more amusement,

6892
00:18:50,560 --> 00:18:51,790
boy.

6893
00:18:59,260 --> 00:19:00,690
That shockwave just now...

6894
00:19:09,170 --> 00:19:10,230
Our positions...

6895
00:19:11,130 --> 00:19:13,590
Assassin, are you...

6896
00:19:15,200 --> 00:19:17,510
If I disengage from this man, he will use it.

6897
00:19:18,380 --> 00:19:19,660
His sword technique...

6898
00:19:21,540 --> 00:19:24,700
Is it wise to pull your blows?

6899
00:19:24,700 --> 00:19:28,270
If you persist, I could force you back.

6900
00:19:28,800 --> 00:19:31,850
Is that why you deliberately entered my range?

6901
00:19:32,300 --> 00:19:35,280
I have come to force an end to our contest, of course.

6902
00:19:35,280 --> 00:19:38,860
When in a duel, do not let your mind wander to what comes after.

6903
00:19:39,650 --> 00:19:42,800
If I try to put some distance between us,

6904
00:19:42,800 --> 00:19:44,850
I will play right into his hands.

6905
00:19:46,060 --> 00:19:47,620
Why do you hesitate?

6906
00:19:47,620 --> 00:19:52,150
Just as I guard this gate, you guard something of your own.

6907
00:19:52,150 --> 00:19:54,380
So there should be no room for doubt.

6908
00:19:55,250 --> 00:19:57,380
Besides, Saber...

6909
00:19:57,790 --> 00:20:01,130
You are not the only one running out of time.

6910
00:20:02,890 --> 00:20:04,530
I have done you a discourtesy.

6911
00:20:04,530 --> 00:20:07,560
As you say, we are both out of time.

6912
00:20:33,330 --> 00:20:34,750
Secret technique:

6913
00:20:34,750 --> 00:20:36,170
Swallow Reversal! 

6914
00:20:56,160 --> 00:20:57,110
Go.

6915
00:21:06,710 --> 00:21:09,870
I'd thought her to be a lovely little bird,

6916
00:21:10,910 --> 00:21:14,480
but it seems she was closer to a lioness.

6917
00:21:18,480 --> 00:21:21,660
And to think I considered myself a fair judge of women.

6918
00:21:23,260 --> 00:21:27,680
I suppose my training in that art is equally wanting.

